  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0019",
      "text": "假定原料是10磅棉花。",
      "start_ms": 200,
      "end_ms": 2360,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0020",
      "text": "这里不用重新计算棉花的价值，因为资本家已经在市场上按价值购买了它，价格是10先令。",
      "start_ms": 3200,
      "end_ms": 10160,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0021",
      "text": "生产棉花所需的劳动，已经通过这个价格表现为一般社会劳动。",
      "start_ms": 10800,
      "end_ms": 15680,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0022",
      "text": "我们再假定，纺纱时磨损掉的那部分纺锭价值2先令。",
      "start_ms": 16160,
      "end_ms": 21560,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0023",
      "text": "这里用纺锭代表其他一切劳动手段。",
      "start_ms": 22280,
      "end_ms": 25480,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch05-s02-n0024",
      "text": "棉花和纺锭的价值合计12先令。",
      "start_ms": 26160,
      "end_ms": 29000,
      "timing_source": "provider_subtitle"
    }
  ]
}
